  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "43688dec-2308-4c0b-b4b7-0aae9874a2c8",
    "name": "📌 xAI API",
    "description": "### About xAI\n\n\"SpaceXSI builds Grok — frontier AI models for reasoning, voice, image generation, and more.\"\n\nxAI builds the Grok models and serves them through OpenAI-compatible Chat and Responses APIs, plus image, video and voice. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Model makers**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- xAI Account: [https://console.x.ai/](https://console.x.ai/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `xai_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:xai_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://docs.x.ai/docs/api-reference](https://docs.x.ai/docs/api-reference)\n    \n- Models: [https://docs.x.ai/docs/models](https://docs.x.ai/docs/models)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
